      "explanation": "Fest can mean solid when referring to a material or surface. It can mean tight or tight, like a screw or a knot. fest also often means fixed or determined, such as a deadline. For a job or a relationship, it can mean permanent. So the fest is not just “hard” • Often means stable or constant.",
