      "explanation": "Main idea: stimmen means that something agrees or is right • In another context it means to vote. \"Das stimmt\" = \"It is\" or \"It is right\" is very common in everyday life. In politics or a group, stimmen means to vote. With an instrument, stimmen means to tune.",
